What Are Mercury Vapor Monitors?
Mercury vapor monitors are specialized analytical instruments designed to detect and quantify mercury concentrations in various environments. These devices serve critical functions in:
•	Industrial workplace safety monitoring
•	Environmental pollution control
•	Regulatory compliance verification
•	Contaminated site assessment
The market offers diverse monitoring solutions ranging from portable handheld units for field measurements to sophisticated continuous emission monitoring systems (CEMS) for industrial applications. Recent technological innovations have focused on improving detection thresholds to parts-per-trillion levels using advanced atomic fluorescence spectroscopy techniques.
